sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client App
    participant API as FastAPI Server
    participant Auth as WorkOS JWT
    participant Prompt as Prompt Orchestrator
    participant MCP as MCP Composer
    participant Claude as Claude (Vertex AI)
    participant DB as Supabase

    Client->>API: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(JWT Token + Messages)
    API->>Auth: Validate JWT Token
    Auth-->>API: User Context (user_id, org_id)

    API->>Prompt: Get System Prompt
    Note over Prompt: 4-Level Hierarchy:<br/>Platform → Org → User → Workflow
    Prompt->>DB: Query prompt tables
    DB-->>Prompt: Prompt configs
    Prompt-->>API: Composed System Prompt

    API->>MCP: Compose MCP Servers
    MCP->>DB: Get enabled servers for user
    DB-->>MCP: Server configs + OAuth tokens
    MCP-->>API: Composed MCP Server

    API->>Claude: Send Request<br/>(Messages + System Prompt + Tools)

    alt Streaming Response
        Claude-->>API: SSE: delta tokens
        API-->>Client: SSE: data chunks
        Claude-->>API: SSE: [DONE]
        API-->>Client: SSE: [DONE]
    else Non-Streaming
        Claude-->>API: Complete Response
        API-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    API->>DB: Save Chat History
    DB-->>API: Confirmation
